=\"Θεοδούλη\"><span data-text=\"Θεοδούλη\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Θεοδούλη\">ΘΕΟΔΟΥΛΗ</span></span></span><span data-text=\"ζή\n                    σασα\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΖΗ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΣΑΣΑ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">[.]ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"κβ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"κβ\">ΚΒ</span>❦<span data-text=\"τελευτᾷ\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ΤΕΛΕΥΤΑ</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗ</span><br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">ΠΡΟ</span><span data-text=\"γ\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"γ\">Γ</span><span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"kalendae\">ΚΑΛ</span>𐆠<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰανουαρίων\"><span data-text=\"Ἰανουαρίων\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"Ianuarius\">ΙΑΝΟΥΑΡΙΩΝ</span></span><br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span><span data-text=\"ἐδόθη\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"δίδωμι\">ΕΔΟΘΗ</span><span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"120\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">ΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">Η</span><span data-text=\"ἔνβασις\" data-n=\"130\" data-lemma=\"ἔμβασις\">ΕΝΒΑΣΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"κατὰ\" data-n=\"135\" data-lemma=\"κατά\">ΚΑΤΑ</span><span data-text=\"δωρε\n                    ὰν\" data-n=\"140\" data-lemma=\"δωρεά\">ΔΩΡΕ<br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span>ΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"σφραγῖδος\" data-n=\"145\" data-lemma=\"σφραγίς\">ΣΦΡΑΓΙΔΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"τῆς\" data-n=\"150\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗΣ</span><span data-text=\"πρεσβυτέρας\" data-n=\"155\" data-lemma=\"πρέσβυς\">ΠΡΕΣΒΥΤΕ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\">l.2 reg., orig. ΚΕΙΤΤΕκεῖττε</p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"κεῖται\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">ΚΕΙΤΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"ἀεὶ\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ἀεί\">ΑΕΙ</span><span data-text=\"παρθένος\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"παρθένος\">ΠΑΡΘΕΝΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ὀνόματι\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ὄνομα\">ΟΝΟΜΑΤΙ</span><span data-text=\"Θεοδούλη\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Θεοδούλη\">ΘΕΟΔΟΥΛΗ</span><span data-text=\"ζήσασα\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΖΗΣΑΣΑ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"κβ\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"κβ\">ΚΒ</span><span data-text=\"τελευτᾷ\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ΤΕΛΕΥΤΑ</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">ΠΡΟ</span><span data-text=\"γ\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"γ\">Γ</span><span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"kalendae\">ΚΑΛΑΝΔΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"Ἰανουαρίων\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"Ianuarius\">ΙΑΝΟΥΑΡΙΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἐδόθη\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"δίδωμι\">ΕΔΟΘΗ</span><span data-text=\"δὲ\" data-n=\"120\" data-lemma=\"δέ\">ΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">Η</span><span data-text=\"ἔνβασις\" data-n=\"130\" data-lemma=\"ἔμβασις\">ΕΝΒΑΣΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"κατὰ\" data-n=\"135\" data-lemma=\"κατά\">ΚΑΤΑ</span><span data-text=\"δωρεὰν\" data-n=\"140\" data-lemma=\"δωρεά\">ΔΩΡΕΑΝ</span><span data-text=\"σφραγῖδος\" data-n=\"145\" data-lemma=\"σφραγίς\">ΣΦΡΑΓΙΔΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"τῆς\" data-n=\"150\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗΣ</span><span data-text=\"πρεσβυτέρας\" data-n=\"155\" data-lemma=\"πρέσβυς\">ΠΡΕΣΒΥΤΕΡΑΣ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "apparatus",
      "html": "<h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of Rizza and Bitto</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 7\">line.7: <span>σφραγῖδος τῆς πρεσβυτέ(ρας) Bitto; σφραγῖδος τῆς πρεσβυτέ(ρου) Ferrua; τῆς πρεσβυτε(ρικῆς) Manganaro, Rizzone</span></span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Here lies the ever-virgin Theodoule, who lived for 22 years. She died three days before the Kalends of January. A burial place was granted to her on account of the gift of the oldest and most prestigious sphragis.</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "commentary",
      "html": "<h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The funerary inscription was discovered within a burial complex associated with the cult of the martyrs, including an adjoining basilica, dating to the 4th-6th centuries AD and located in the central-southern sector of the insula bounded by Via Androne, Via Tomaselli, and Via Dottor Consoli (cf. Rizza 1964). The young deceased, Theodoule (for this Christian name in Catania, see also IMusCatania 167 = ISic001648), who died at only twenty-two years of age, is described as <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀειπαρθένος</span> (\"ever-virgin\"), an epithet of consecrated virgins frequently attested in Christian epigraphy (cf. Rizzone 2008, 179). Lines 6–7 mention the grant of the burial place, but the passage is difficult to interpret because of the uncertain resolution of the final abbreviated word. Ferrua (1989, no. 425) expanded it as <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">σφραγῖδος τῆς πρεσβυτέ(ρου)</span>, interpreting \"the seal of the priest\" as a reference to baptism. On this interpretation, Theodoule would have been baptized relatively late in life, a conclusion that sits uneasily with her designation as <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἀειπαρθένος</span>. Bitto (1996), by contrast, restored <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">σφραγῖδος τῆς πρεσβυτέ(ρας)</span>, interpreting the phrase as \"on account of the gift of the highest sphragis,\" namely the martyr's baptism. According to this interpretation, Theodoule enjoyed a privileged status that would explain her burial within such a prestigious funerary complex, which also appears to have accommodated the young Iulia Florentina (CIL X 7112 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000083\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000083</a>), buried <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"la\">apud fores martyrum</span>. This interpretation seems preferable, although it is difficult to dismiss entirely Manganaro's proposal (1993, 560), who restored <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">σφραγῖδος τῆς πρεσβυτε(ρικῆς)</span> and interpreted the expression as \"by a deed of donation authenticated with the presbyter's seal,\" attributing to it an administrative meaning connected with the concession of burial in ecclesiastical buildings.</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "bibliography",
      "html": "<h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Rizza 1964 604 no.1 fig.13 <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/9FWKQU6Q\" target=\"_blank\">  </a><a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10003143\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10003143</a>  </li><li> Ferrua 1989 no.425 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001995\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001995</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1993 560 fig.5 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001827\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001827</a>  </li><li> 1996 792 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283</a>  </li><li> 1996 46.1261 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> Bitto 1996 279-292 <a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/DMBTEE76\" target=\"_blank\">  </a><a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002146\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002146</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li> Rizzone 2008 179 </li></ul>  "
    },
